{%- comment -%}
  AJ Email Popup — the capture that interrupts.

  RENDERED FROM theme.liquid, NOT FROM A SECTION GROUP. Section-group JSON is
  owned by the theme editor and repo edits to it are silently ignored, so a
  popup added there would work until someone opened the editor. A static
  `{% section %}` in the layout is repo-controlled and still gets theme-editor
  settings.

  IT EARNS ITS INTERRUPTION OR IT DOES NOT APPEAR:

  - Never on the join page or on checkout. Interrupting someone already looking
    at the form is the worst version of this pattern.
  - Never twice. A dismissal is remembered for a configurable number of days,
    and a signup is remembered permanently — the fastest way to make someone
    hate a brand is to ask again after they said yes.
  - Not immediately. It waits, so the first thing a visitor sees is the Yoink
    rather than a modal over it. Someone who leaves in three seconds was never
    going to subscribe, and asking them anyway costs the impression.
  - Exit intent on desktop, delay on mobile — there is no cursor to leave with
    on a phone, so exit intent alone would mean it effectively never fires there.

  THE OFFER IS ACCESS, NOT A DISCOUNT, for the same reason as the join page:
  the Yoink is clamped near cost and the bin runs at a 20% floor, so another
  discount comes out of a $12.67 contribution. Early access costs nothing.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  THE SETTING IS "disabled", NOT "enabled", and that is not a style choice.

  A static section that has never been opened in the theme editor has no stored
  settings, and Shopify does not fall back to schema defaults for those — the
  setting reads as nil. An `if enabled` test therefore renders nothing, and so
  does `if enabled != false`, because Liquid evaluates `nil == false` as TRUE.
  Both spellings produce a popup that exists in the theme and never once appears.

  Inverting the flag sidesteps the whole question: nil is falsy, so an unsaved
  section renders, and only an explicit tick suppresses it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- unless section.settings.disabled -%}
  <aj-email-popup
    class="aj-pop"
    hidden
    data-delay="{{ section.settings.delay_seconds | default: 12 }}"
    data-remember-days="{{ section.settings.remember_days | default: 30 }}"
    data-exit-intent="{{ section.settings.exit_intent }}"
  >
    <div class="aj-pop__backdrop" data-close></div>

    <div class="aj-pop__panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="aj-pop-title">
      <button class="aj-pop__x" type="button" data-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>

      <div data-state="form">
        <h2 class="aj-pop__title" id="aj-pop-title">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
          <p class="aj-pop__sub">{{ section.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- form 'customer', class: 'aj-pop__form' -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="{{ section.settings.tag | escape }}">
          <label class="visually-hidden" for="aj-pop-email">Email address</label>
          <input
            id="aj-pop-email"
            class="aj-pop__input"
            type="email"
            name="contact[email]"
            placeholder="you@example.com"
            autocomplete="email"
            required
          >
          <button class="aj-pop__submit" type="submit">{{ section.settings.button_text | escape }}</button>
          {%- if section.settings.fine_print != blank -%}
            <p class="aj-pop__fine">{{ section.settings.fine_print | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endform -%}

        <button class="aj-pop__decline" type="button" data-close>
          {{ section.settings.decline_text | escape }}
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </aj-email-popup>

  <script src="{{ 'aj-email-popup.js' | asset_url }}" type="module" fetchpriority="low"></script>
{%- endunless -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .aj-pop { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1000; display: block; }
  .aj-pop[hidden] { display: none; }

  .aj-pop__backdrop {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5);
    animation: aj-pop-fade 0.25s ease;
  }

  .aj-pop__panel {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%; top: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: min(30rem, calc(100vw - 2rem));
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgb(var(--color-background-rgb, 255 255 255));
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17));
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.28);
    animation: aj-pop-rise 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.3, 1);
  }

  @keyframes aj-pop-fade { from { opacity: 0 } to { opacity: 1 } }
  @keyframes aj-pop-rise {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, calc(-50% + 12px)); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .aj-pop__backdrop, .aj-pop__panel { animation: none; }
  }

  .aj-pop__x {
    position: absolute; top: 0.5rem; right: 0.75rem;
    background: none; border: 0; cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 1.75rem; line-height: 1; opacity: 0.5;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .aj-pop__x:hover { opacity: 1; }

  .aj-pop__title { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.2; }
  .aj-pop__sub { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; opacity: 0.75; }

  .aj-pop__form { display: grid; gap: 0.7rem; }

  .aj-pop__input {
    box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem; font-size: 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.25);
    background: rgb(var(--color-background-rgb, 255 255 255));
    color: inherit;
  }

  .aj-pop__submit {
    padding: 0.95rem 1rem; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700;
    border: 0; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer;
    background: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb)); color: rgb(var(--color-background-rgb, 255 255 255));
  }
  .aj-pop__submit:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

  .aj-pop__fine { margin: 0; font-size: 0.78rem; opacity: 0.6; }

  /* A plain, low-contrast decline rather than a guilt-tripped "no thanks, I hate
     savings". Dark patterns buy one signup and cost the brand. */
  .aj-pop__decline {
    margin-top: 0.9rem; width: 100%;
    background: none; border: 0; cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.55; color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .aj-pop__decline:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "AJ Email Popup",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Shows once per visitor. Never on the join page, never again after a signup, and not again after a dismissal until the window below has passed."
    },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "disabled", "label": "Turn the popup off", "default": false },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "One deal a day. Yours first." },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "subheading", "label": "Subheading",
      "default": "We'll send tomorrow's Yoink before it goes live. One email a day, nothing else."
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "button_text", "label": "Button", "default": "Send it to me" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "decline_text", "label": "Decline link", "default": "No thanks" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "fine_print", "label": "Fine print", "default": "One email a day. Unsubscribe anytime." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tag", "label": "Customer tag", "default": "popup" },
    {
      "type": "range", "id": "delay_seconds", "label": "Delay before showing",
      "min": 3, "max": 60, "step": 1, "unit": "s", "default": 12,
      "info": "Long enough that the Yoink is seen first."
    },
    {
      "type": "range", "id": "remember_days", "label": "Don't ask again for",
      "min": 1, "max": 180, "step": 1, "unit": "d", "default": 30
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox", "id": "exit_intent", "label": "Also show on exit intent (desktop)", "default": true
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
